================================================================================
SCOPE — WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES AND DOES NOT COVER
================================================================================

The MIT licence above applies ONLY to the software in this repository: the
Python build scripts, the stylesheets, the client-side JavaScript, and the HTML
templates.

It does NOT apply to:

  data/            Metadata and document descriptions derived from the
                   Princeton Geniza Project, © Princeton Geniza Lab, Princeton
                   University, licensed CC BY-NC 4.0. The Hebrew descriptions
                   are adaptations of those originals and carry the same terms.
                   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

  assets/fonts/    Frank Ruhl Libre and Heebo, licensed under the SIL Open Font
                   License 1.1. See assets/fonts/OFL.txt.

  Manuscript images are not contained in this repository at all. They are
  loaded over IIIF directly from the holding libraries and remain subject to
  each institution's own terms — most of them non-commercial. See README.md.

Reusing the code is free. Reusing the data is not unconditional: it requires
attribution to the Princeton Geniza Project, a link to the licence, an
indication of what was changed, and non-commercial use only.
